#: ../../administration/identity_sources/ad.rst:2
msgid "Active Directory"
msgstr "Active Directory"

#: ../../administration/identity_sources/ad.rst:5
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Descripción general"

#: ../../administration/identity_sources/ad.rst:7
msgid ""
"Active Directory is Microsoft’s primary authentication service widely used "
"in Enterprise organizations and even via Microsoft’s cloud services. While "
"Active Directory also supports LDAP protocol support (which |morpheus| can "
"integrate with as well), the main Active Directory integration can also be "
"utilized. It is even possible to map Active Directory groups to equivalent "
"Roles within |morpheus| ."
msgstr ""
"Active Directory es Microsoft’s primary autenticación service widely usado "
"en Enterprise organizations y even a través de Microsoft’s cloud services. "
"While Active Directory también supports LDAP protocol soporte (que "
"|morpheus| puede integrate con as well), el main Active Directory "
"integración puede también be utilized. Es even possible a map Active "
"Directory grupos a equivalent Roles dentro de |morpheus| ."

#: ../../administration/identity_sources/ad.rst:9
msgid ""
"To use Active Directory, a valid / trusted SSL certificate must be in place "
"on the Active Directory services (self signed will not work)."
msgstr ""
"Un usar Active Directory, a valid / trusted SSL certificate debe ser en "
"place en el Active Directory services (self signed no work)."

#: ../../administration/identity_sources/ad.rst:12
msgid "Adding an Active Directory Integration"
msgstr "Adding un Active Directory Integración"

