#: ../../administration/identity_sources/ad.rst:35
msgid "Default Role"
msgstr "Predeterminado Rol"

#: ../../administration/identity_sources/ad.rst:36
msgid ""
"The default role a user is assigned if no group is listed under AD user that"
" maps under Role Mappings section."
msgstr ""
"El predeterminado rol a usuario es asignado si no grupo es listed under AD "
"usuario ese maps under Rol Mappings sección."

#: ../../administration/identity_sources/ad.rst:38
msgid "Service Account Holder"
msgstr "Service Cuenta Holder"

#: ../../administration/identity_sources/ad.rst:38
msgid ""
"This is the admin account type in |morpheus| and an AD group can be created "
"and populated to a user that this role should be assigned. Roles are "
"assigned dynamically based on group membership."
msgstr ""
"Este es el admin cuenta tipo en |morpheus| y un AD grupo puede ser creado y "
"populated a a usuario ese este rol debería ser asignado. Roles son asignado "
"dynamically basado en grupo membership."

#: ../../administration/identity_sources/ad.rst:40
msgid "Select :guilabel:`SAVE CHANGES`."
msgstr "Seleccionar :guilabel:`SAVE CHANGES`."

#: ../../administration/identity_sources/ad.rst:42
msgid ""
"Now allowed AD users can login to |morpheus| via their Active Directory "
"credentials and a User will be automatically generated to |morpheus| with "
"matching metadata and mapped Role permissions."
msgstr ""
"Now allowed AD usuarios puede inicio de sesión a |morpheus| a través de su "
"Active Directory credenciales y a Usuario será automáticamente generated a "
"|morpheus| con matching metadata y mapped Rol permisos."

#: ../../administration/identity_sources/ad.rst:44
msgid "Only the username is required with password, not the username@domain."
msgstr ""
"Solo el usuarioname es obligatorio con contraseña, no el usuarioname@domain."
